OL,3,AWelfare bill will be reduced before
OL,4,Anext election, chancellor tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey tells the BBC
OL,7,Fthere "will be a reduction in the
OL,8,Fbenefits bill" before the next general
OL,9,Felection, after delivering his first
OL,10,FBudget
OL,12,FIn a pre-recorded interview, the
OL,13,Fchancellor says it is "simply not good
OL,14,Ffor Britain or progressive to have a
OL,15,Fbigger and bigger benefits bill"
OL,17,FHis comments come after the
OL,18,FConservatives accused Labour of being
OL,19,F"addicted to welfare", while Reform UK
OL,20,Fsaid the Budget did not address the
OL,21,F"ballooning" benefits bill
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
