OL,3,AWelfare bill will be reduced before
OL,4,Anext election, chancellor tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelfare spending is forecast to rise
OL,7,Fthis year to #353bn - and to #431bn in
OL,8,F2031/32, according to government
OL,9,Fspending watchdog the Office for Budget
OL,10,FResponsibility (OBR)
OL,12,FIn his Budget, Healey included a #100
OL,13,Fenergy payment for 20 million
OL,14,Fhouseholds in England and tax rises on
OL,15,Fsome savings and rental profits - a
OL,16,Fquick guide to the policy announcements
